& [Situation]
  + portable package identity is complete while operator configuration diagnostics remain absent
  + exact resident-service validation exists but is coupled to a later listener-binding startup path

& [Justification]
  + a no-listener diagnostic over the unchanged validators is the smallest useful operator-product step
  + duplicating the rules in PowerShell would create semantic drift and raw startup error forwarding would violate redaction

& [Solution]
  + add typed diagnostic forms one in-process staged validator projection and cantord check-config machine mode with deterministic fixtures verifier docs and portable-bundle refresh

& [Delineation]
  + reading selected local artifacts for validation is inside
  + raw path token content hash source environment content and OS error messages are outside the public report
  + configuration repair creation secret provisioning startup listener provider migration upgrade effects remote FPGA and Minecraft are outside

& [Decision]
  + activate additive Rust diagnostic forms function CLI mode tests checked evidence verifier docs governance and successor bundle refresh only
